note seed/host/execfds/refusals/fnmode.om: execfds is program-only: an OM-2 function unit (no fn main) refuses it, error 9.
om2
fn bad a view uchar 8 b view uchar 8 k view uchar 8 to long
ret execfds a 0 8 b 0 8 k 0 0
end
note gate-pools: uses execfds on purpose: owner=seed/host/execfds/check.sh new-word acceptance or refusal qualification
